(text "Gigabit Ethernet and 802.3bt PoE powered device" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a213a91-a8df-599a-9f3d-67398081f970"))
(text "ISOLATION: every net on the cable side of U17 (V1-V4, VPOE_*, POE_VIN_*, POE_T4DET, POE_OPTO_A) is the PoE primary domain.\nKeep 2.5mm creepage to all other copper and no planes under it (net class PoE_Primary). Rated 1500V impulse (Ag5810 datasheet 4).\nTwo Schottky bridges (eight PMEG10020) accept power on either or both pairsets and either polarity. U17 presents Class 7; the\njack is rated 600mA per centre tap, which bounds PoE input at 60W PSE power. Opto U18 tells Linux when a Type 4 PSE is present." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56e2fc4e-bc04-54f9-b8cd-06c436bbb7f7"))
